{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|397730FA4E6DD36510BD1BA472E78493", "source_en": "A catalyst for a new age.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "محفزٌ لعصرٍ جديد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3A99870E492589A6F30E58867AED2978", "source_en": "Ah, lost notes on the founding of the Order of the Crimson Moon.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "آه، ملاحظاتٌ مفقودةٌ حول تأسيس جماعة القمر القرمزي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3B407F9F456914A7BCEEE78E528CFD5B", "source_en": "Where have you been, knight?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أين كنتَ، أيها الفارس؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3B448C8B486BB4D71F5DBCBB79CE681E", "source_en": "This land is full of secrets.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هذه الأرضُ تفيضُ بالأسرار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3B6015E54F3006F784DEFBAA5C096590", "source_en": "But it reads nonsense!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لكنها تبدو هراءً!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3C042EBE4A37D0D76FEC1089DAD68DE7", "source_en": "The cipher! You found it.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "الشفرة! لقد وجدتها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3C9315C349B0E69217F2FEBCB1B1B0C0", "source_en": "I can't read with you watching.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لا يمكنني القراءة وأنت تراقبني.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3CD6C43C453A20FBB9CDF9B1784A9894", "source_en": "No. I believe that figure, Nephilim, was you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كلا. أظن أن ذلك الكائن، النيفيليم، كان أنت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3EBA051346C5248C3D20418266DAF1F3", "source_en": "What is it?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ما الأمر؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|3FA6A5C4460DC6C41F2762A3787A3978", "source_en": "I fear one day you'll need it.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أخشى أنك ستحتاج إليه يوماً ما.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|40784DC7424DEA82B06263B46112CE39", "source_en": "Here, take this.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "خذ هذا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|40B05C064F8EC7BCB9B7F9B1277D647E", "source_en": "Now where did I leave that... hmm...", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أين وضعتُ ذلك... همم...", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|40CFA5F74F5D32EC9C80D9928D223E46", "source_en": "Knight.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها الفارس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|410E2F0C439C66FB6032CBBA9AEB7F1C", "source_en": "In truth, he was a disciple of Cain.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "في الحقيقة، كان تلميذًا لكاين.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|43F5BE5F4337CED6044F28AA86E7064C", "source_en": "Ah... scrolls from the Southern Ward. The oldest quarter of Gildeus, settled long ago along the Aemar River. It was there the Church first arrived, claiming to spread the Lunitarian word... Though these records suggest their purpose may have been... something more.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "آه... لفائف من الحي الجنوبي. أقدم أحياء جيلديوس، التي استوطنت منذ أمد بعيد على طول نهر أيمار. هناك وصلت الكنيسة أول مرة، زاعمةً نشر كلمة اللونيتاري... رغم أن هذه السجلات تشير إلى أن غرضهم قد يكون... شيئًا آخر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|4708FF2C4755821E5FCFB9B998779E4F", "source_en": "A request for you, child.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لدي طلب لك، يا بني.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|47E23701476D201598B524B07A655434", "source_en": "Sadly, the surviving pages offer little more.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "للأسف، لا تقدم الصفحات المتبقية سوى القليل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|498F58524440A52C313959A5AF7EDA29", "source_en": "I wonder if they knew what they were truly building.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أتساءل عما إذا كانوا يدركون حقًا ما كانوا يبنونه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|499CAC604CC511AA16C7528CC8CD2F4B", "source_en": "Nephilim, you're here.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها النيفيليم، لقد وصلت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|49EAAE68409D8D8E0EB2819A8022D0E1", "source_en": "If there's nothing else, I have books to read.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "إن لم يكن هناك شيء آخر، فلدي كتبٌ عليّ قراءتها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|4C8AA1254E240D86157C07AA11D1950F", "source_en": "I've been waiting, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كنتُ بانتظارك، أيها النيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|4C9FA4674FDAB6B6849CE69ACCEB0C48", "source_en": "Approach, child.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "اقترب، يا بني.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|4F1463664B35E5195CE85590E28C1B06", "source_en": "Nephilim, here for another story?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها النيفيليم، أأتيتَ من أجل قصةٍ أخرى؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|52475A52417725B782AA418B1438AD75", "source_en": "Welcome, child.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أهلاً بك، يا بني.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|529E1F8D4A4B1A19CBBC08B10B04BBF6", "source_en": "And so the key was split for three.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "وهكذا، قُسِّمت المفتاحُ بين ثلاثة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|52EA548B4DE35AD26A393693AE437437", "source_en": "News from the field?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أثمة أخبارٌ من الميدان؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|53498A9F4629D055A0287C8C01876A23", "source_en": "The Order was his answer to that injustice.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كانت الجماعةُ هي ردّته على ذلك الظلم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|53622E104C46336BA2B032A16AD5A030", "source_en": "I knew you'd return.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كنتُ أعلمُ أنك ستعود.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|54D58ABB40BF68A1231053A97353D381", "source_en": "Those are tomes, not a sparing dummy!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هذه مجلداتٌ، وليست دميةً للتدريب!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|55A3D9C64FB8A4A6A27E8490448D999D", "source_en": "Approach.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "اقترب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|55F9CD7F4C3BAA167116259AA24C0F85", "source_en": "Have you ever heard the story of your coffin? Belonged to Valkiel, one of the earliest Nephilim. Died almost immediately. Couldn't let a perfectly good coffin go to waste, so now its yours.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هل سمعت يوماً قصة تابوتك هذا؟ لقد كان ملكاً لـ \"فالكيل\"، أحد أوائل النيفيليم. فارق الحياة فوراً تقريباً. ولم يكن بوسعنا ترك تابوتٍ سليمٍ كهذا يذهب سدى، لذا فهو لك الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|56BEC4ED42A8D88EEABEF9898FC7FB29", "source_en": "Solomon's Gala marked the beginning of the Hellgrowth's outbreak.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كانت حفلة \"سولومون\" هي إيذاناً ببدء تفشي النماء الجهنّمي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5706C3D246520E94ED2EB2827829FDF2", "source_en": "These records predate the modern Church.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هذه السجلات تسبق الكنيسة الحديثة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|585ED4654FC1D0DECD0E1294BAB4DF9C", "source_en": "Again this cult comes up in the notes.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تظهر هذه الطائفة مرة أخرى في الملاحظات.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|595A132148B11DC19F9EC5BD3586DA7E", "source_en": "What troubles you?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ما الذي يؤرقك؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5AE548DB4D67D9B6A9C8CE8AC30921C4", "source_en": "Hail child.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحية لك يا طفل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5B0C6E434E1BA233CC68E3925BBDE647", "source_en": "You're back.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لقد عدت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5B608287452F4A1864F8379352585F41", "source_en": "You may go.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "يمكنك الذهاب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5CE64A72472E53E639C9B6BACB241C6A", "source_en": "Hail.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحية لك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5D1BE89647BDC57075B366B973D16DD4", "source_en": "Put those back when you're done, dear.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أعد تلك الأشياء إلى مكانها حين تنتهي، يا عزيزي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5D58F5174674A1C1D6AA139787E2A58F", "source_en": "I've been reading our little book.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كنتُ أقرأ كتابنا الصغير.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|5F0ABE134F1E91F0D755EF9D2DF831FC", "source_en": "The text reads:", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ينص النص على ما يلي:", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|61952F6541145879AF1DE08C3C7151CA", "source_en": "What does the church want with these Abraxas Stones?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ما الذي تنشده الكنيسة من أحجار أبراكساس هذه؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|6248E64B4A8524F1D3686C988852044A", "source_en": "Speak.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحدّث.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|62C36B8F4F183F6ACD54E4A31C2FB85F", "source_en": "Could it be the cause of their feral nature...", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيمكن أن يكون هذا هو سبب طبيعتهم الوحشية...", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|6306E3884C83A06F43CD90BF659BB812", "source_en": "Written over one hundred years ago. When I was still mortal. ", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كُتب هذا قبل أكثر من مئة عام. حين كنتُ لا أزال فانية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|63E8817B4E91A4F5FEEFD1886E1015AE", "source_en": "Greetings, child.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحيةً لك، أيها الصغير.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|6494E72C48F6E49B63864690438BCD02", "source_en": "One in the Cathedral. One in the Crypt.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "واحد في الكاتدرائية. والآخر في السرداب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|658D0B154DE07B06291870955127FA32", "source_en": "The Marauder's Almanac... this should be in the archives.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"مخطوطة المعتدي... كان ينبغي أن تكون في الأرشيف.\"", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|65B1D9F4481F81D527B3F29C005DF760", "source_en": "Hail, brute.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"تحيةً لك، أيها الهمجي.\"", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|675F5883443ED50CD695F49F12FA3D01", "source_en": "Until we meet again.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"إلى أن نلتقي ثانية.\"", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|67FBD6174A07AED6FFF970B3D5249F6F", "source_en": "What secrets do you hold?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أي أسرارٍ تخفي في جعبتك؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|6DC8BB3C455EA4E1DFD8B28747724815", "source_en": "You may leave now.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "يمكنك الانصراف الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|6E6916DF4D1376EE24FECFB38BD758AC", "source_en": "To think, you spend your whole life reading about apocalyptic events and never do you dream you might get to live during them! Oh. Of course it's very sad what happened to your brothers out there. Very sad indeed. That tower... it siphoned the souls of all the living. Except yours. Remarkable. Perhaps you can be of use. They say the church knew nothing about that tower, yet now they know all about these... stones. There's more to this story. Something only a proper scholar could deduce. Should you find anything of note, bring it here.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "من المثير للتفكير أنك تقضي حياتك بأكملها في قراءة أخبار الأحداث الكارثية، دون أن يخطر ببالك أبدًا أنك قد تعيشها فعليًا! أوه، بالطبع، ما حدث لإخوتك هناك أمرٌ محزن للغاية. محزنٌ حقًا. ذلك البرج... لقد امتص أرواح كل الأحياء. باستثناء روحك. أمرٌ لافت. ربما يمكنك أن تكون ذا فائدة. يقولون إن الكنيسة لم تكن تعلم شيئًا عن ذلك البرج، لكنها الآن تعلم كل شيء عن هذه... الأحجار. هناك المزيد في هذه القصة. شيءٌ لا يمكن إلا لعالمٍ حقيقي استنتاجه. إن وجدت أي شيءٍ ذي أهمية، فاحضره إلى هنا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|729B69A74AEBB31F70CC8D95A2BEB9AF", "source_en": "The Reborn transformed it into a staging ground for the Infernal Legion.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لقد حوله المولودون من جديد إلى ساحة انطلاق للفيلق الجهنّمي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|72E0BF4740D1F603A01EA2A44E9681A4", "source_en": "Knight, what bringith?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها الفارس، ما الذي جلبك إلى هنا؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7309BDAE4A8DB7B322E898BE914B9A0B", "source_en": "Hmm? Oh it's you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "همم؟ أوه، أنت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|742BD32546045B610B25DDB6E629A65A", "source_en": "Hmm?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "همم؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7520D44E4C8B03640A8A4A877CE5BE60", "source_en": "For him, the Rite of Desolation never truly ended.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "بالنسبة له، لم ينتهِ طقس الخراب حقاً أبداً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|75B6071E429ADA6D42861498E7B8D9B7", "source_en": "I wonder who benefited most from their confusion.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أتساءل من كان المستفيد الأكبر من ارتباكهم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 24}}
